American mathematician.

00:15:54.540 --> 00:15:56.710
I maybe I just, I can't
not tell this story.

00:15:56.710 --> 00:16:01.710
I mean, so he came to the
University of Virginia in 1844,

00:16:04.240 --> 00:16:05.520
at a time when there was essentially

00:16:05.520 --> 00:16:09.740
no research map enterprise
