Yale at this point in time.

00:17:19.490 --> 00:17:24.490
It was very aristocratic and
what was appealing perhaps

00:17:24.490 --> 00:17:27.310
to the faculty the idea of this
distinguished senior scholar

00:17:27.310 --> 00:17:29.930
was not appealing to the students at all.

00:17:29.930 --> 00:17:32.700
Sylvester expected obedience,

00:17:32.700 --> 00:17:35.100
he expected attention to lessons,

00:17:35.100 --> 00:17:37.850
he did not treat this sort of aristocratic

00:17:37.850 --> 00:17:39.800
mostly Southern students
at University of Virginia

00:17:39.800 --> 00:17:42.620
with the deference that they expected.

00:17:42.620 --> 00:17:45.110
And the semester ended with Sylvester

00:17:46.260 --> 00:17:49.543
getting into a physical
fractious with an undergraduate

00:17:52.022 --> 00:17:54.430
thinking that he had
killed the undergraduate.

00:17:54.430 --> 00:17:56.180
He fled United States

00:17:57.550 --> 00:17:59.507
and went back to England
and built his career there

00:17:59.507 --> 00:18:01.210
and did eventually come back to the U.S.

00:18:01.210 --> 00:18:02.800
to teach Johns Hopkins in 1870s.

00:18:02.800 --> 00:18:04.300
But essentially that was

00:18:04.300 --> 00:18:07.270
the cause of essentially a 30 year delay

00:18:07.270 --> 00:18:09.500
